1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:08,000
Casa Escondida — Hybrid AI Reservation Intake & Qualification (Web & WhatsApp).

2
00:00:08,000 --> 00:00:18,000
Guests can inquire naturally across multiple turns on Web or WhatsApp while the Neuro-Symbolic AI extracts verified booking data.

3
00:00:18,000 --> 00:00:30,000
Scene 1: Web Console (/test-console). A guest sends an initial inquiry for 6 people (4 divers, 2 non-divers) checking in on November 15.

4
00:00:30,000 --> 00:00:44,000
Pass 1 & Pass 2 extract every stated fact with verbatim evidence, and the AI asks only for the missing fields—never re-asking known slots.

5
00:00:44,000 --> 00:00:58,000
In Turn 2, the guest provides the remaining details: 3 nights, 3 Deluxe rooms, full-board meals, and diving dates (Nov 16–17).

6
00:00:58,000 --> 00:01:12,000
All 6 core booking slots are now complete (done = true), producing a verified structured Trip payload ready for the reservation team.

7
00:01:12,000 --> 00:01:26,000
Scene 2: Real-Time WhatsApp Interaction. Sir Sky messages on WhatsApp to book for 10 guests across 4 nights (October 10–14).

8
00:01:26,000 --> 00:01:40,000
Within 2 seconds, the AI confirms the check-in dates, 5 twin rooms, and full-board meal plan, then asks if the group will be diving.

9
00:01:40,000 --> 00:01:58,000
Next, the guest changes the headcount to 8 divers, splits the dive schedule (4 divers x 3 days, 4 divers x 2 days), and asks for a 30% partner discount.

10
00:01:58,000 --> 00:02:15,000
The Deterministic Math & Fact Gate updates the total guests from 10 to 8 without double-counting and captures the split-day dive notes.

11
00:02:15,000 --> 00:02:30,000
Crucially, the Fact Gate blocks unauthorized price promises, confirms all verified details to the guest, and raises a Staff Alert for the 30% partner discount.
